====Verb====
{{en-verb}}

# {{anchor|absentfrom}}{{lb|en|reflexive}} To keep (oneself) away.
#: {{ux|en|Most of the men are retired, jobless, or have otherwise temporarily '''absented''' themselves from the workplace.}}
